# HAVEN API base URL (for PRODUCTION builds only).
#
# Use the Vite dev proxy (`/` on localhost) by default — the dev server talks
# straight to local FastAPI at http://127.0.0.1:8000 and never hits the paid AWS
# gateway, so localhost work has no CORS failures and no cost.
#
# Copy to `.env` and set this for production (vite build / Amplify), e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://6qc8x2kc9i.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/dev
#
# To force a different backend during development (not recommended), set:
#   VITE_DEV_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# VITE_API_URL=